2. **The perspective gate never closed** (4.5 exited 1, no `synthesis.md`, no verification). The editor pass flagged it and shipped anyway. The influence-sentence error is precisely the class of defect that gate exists to catch — this matches the P1-error blind spot pattern from the Mahomes run.

